{"parse": {"title": "8TH-13", "pageid": 69777, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/8TH-12\" title=\"8TH-12\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">8TH-13</span><a href=\"/wiki/8TH-14\" title=\"8TH-14\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">8TH</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">13</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.B2.89.E7.BA.A2.E6.B2.B3.E8.B1.9A\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"粉红河豚\">粉红河豚</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 粉红河豚</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Boto Cor-de-Rosa</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>为<span class=\"color-value\"></span>逝<span class=\"color-value\"></span>者<span class=\"color-value\"></span>点<span class=\"color-value\"></span>燃<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>蜡<span class=\"color-value\"></span>烛<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 10813</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_2_bg_rongjunyuan2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_2_bg_rongjunyuan2\"><img alt=\"2_2_bg_rongjunyuan2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Cg-2_2_bg_rongjunyuan2.png/600px-Cg-2_2_bg_rongjunyuan2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Cg-2_2_bg_rongjunyuan2.png/900px-Cg-2_2_bg_rongjunyuan2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Cg-2_2_bg_rongjunyuan2.png/1200px-Cg-2_2_bg_rongjunyuan2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜奶奶：</div><div>喔，今天还有客人？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>是洛佩拉。她平安无事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但苏芙比在哪儿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>大家都躲过了河上的灾难，苏芙比呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>贫民区发生了一些事……她留在那边了，别担心，邓肯跟她在一起，会保护她的安全。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>有个坏消息，德洛丝医生被兄弟会绑架了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>什么？那群白痴，他们只能做出这样孬种的事情吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>……算了算了，先联系基地，老爹会想办法的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310110.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-310110.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310110.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310110.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"22\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-310110.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310110.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-310110.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310110.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"133\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">白朗姆：</div><div>我还以为你沉了！洛佩拉！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>瓶中船不知从哪里冒出来，一股脑地撞到洛佩拉怀中。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>坚硬，勇猛，差点儿能让一位成年男性心肌梗死。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>我的命比这些老家伙的胡渣子还硬，哈哈哈哈，没那么容易死。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>在你沉了之前，我都会好好活着的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>司辰，那边那位是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金伯利躲在医生的房间里，探出半个脑袋，但洛佩拉还是发现了她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>金伯利？你被释放了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>释放？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>追捕逃兵的时候，金伯利在重塑之手的人堆里。我们抓回了她，但老爹并没有把她丢进牢里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>我不知道她去哪儿了，反正老爹肯定有自己的打算。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>嘿，过来打个招呼如何？他什么时候放你走的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>还是说……你是逃出来的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金伯利的眼神闪躲，爪子却紧绷着，似乎下一秒钟就会做出激烈的反应。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我想……她应该救了我，把我从河滩旁拖了出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金伯利女郎：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金伯利女郎：</div><div>你怎么知……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>在我高烧退去后的几个小时里，我大概想起了昏迷前的事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>当时金伯利小姐惊慌失措地呼唤我，“维尔汀……你不能死，你还不能放弃生命……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金伯利女郎：</div><div>什么！我才没有！我把你交到医生那儿我就走了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一声抗议的尖叫从另一侧传来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">白朗姆：</div><div>哎呀，没错，这位小姐不肯承认自己做了好事，明明她有很多机会可以捏碎维尔汀的脖子，但她选择了救她。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">白朗姆：</div><div>我想她不是你的敌人，洛佩拉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金伯利女郎：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>洛佩拉放下戒心，向金伯利放出善意，朝她挥手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阴影中的少女小心翼翼地走出来，仍然与洛佩拉保持着谨慎的距离。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>洛佩拉看着这位有些害怕的“新朋友”——比起在庄园被逮捕时，金伯利换了身新衣服，险些让她认不出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>片刻后，她对紧张的金伯利露出微笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>你当时和重塑之手的人在一起，很难不让人产生怀疑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>以前或许是个误会，我为我曾经的鲁莽道歉，当时情况紧急，我来不及……抱歉，金伯利。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她向金伯利伸出手，示意友好，但金伯利缩着爪子，有点儿迟疑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金伯利女郎：</div><div>好吧。但我不会那么快地原谅你——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金伯利女郎：</div><div>不过，重塑之手、天使兄弟会什么的……我一直搞不清那群复杂的家伙……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>你搞不明白……也很正常。我不会怪你的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>——那你和他们究竟是不是一条船上的呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个突如其来，又顺理成章的发问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金伯利女郎：</div><div>不，当然不是了！我没有船……我不和任何人在一条船上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金伯利女郎：</div><div>一旦我能找到……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她仿佛想起了什么似的，下意识地向四周张望。一无所获。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金伯利女郎：</div><div>我不是你们想要找的那种人。我也没法给你们更多的信息了……如果你想要我离开，我会找个地方待着的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">金伯利女郎：</div><div>只要别再抓我回去……我不想再看到……你们那个东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她不愿意看向洛佩拉腰间。那是一种压抑着的排斥、恐惧……或是某种深藏于心的东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜奶奶：</div><div>好了，孩子们。如果你们想聊事情，至少该找个能坐下的地方。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜奶奶：</div><div>一大群人站在院子门口，这太不像话了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛丽安娜奶奶一手牵起金伯利，一手挽住洛佩拉，把大伙儿“请”回庭院，摆上多糖的帕索卡招待。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>甜食吃太多会伤牙的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜奶奶：</div><div>小孩子才担心这些，到我们这把年纪，想吃点什么，就随心吃。万一明天就走了呢？哈哈！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>玛丽安娜女士，我有一些关于邓肯先生的问题，可以去聊聊吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜奶奶：</div><div>老邓肯又闹出什么麻烦啦？好，走吧，好孩子，把这儿留给她俩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜奶奶：</div><div>洛佩拉，如果你欺负了人家，记得要好好道歉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>每一位远去的朋友都值得怀念。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_2_at_xianliao1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_2_at_xianliao1\"><img alt=\"2_2_at_xianliao1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Cg-2_2_at_xianliao1.png/600px-Cg-2_2_at_xianliao1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"565\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Cg-2_2_at_xianliao1.png/900px-Cg-2_2_at_xianliao1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/Cg-2_2_at_xianliao1.png/1200px-Cg-2_2_at_xianliao1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"2440\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-310201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-310201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-310201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>我相信老爹，如果他放了你，那你一定是无罪的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-310210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-310210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/HeadIconSmall-310210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>你还救了维尔汀，我不会把你当做敌人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-310012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-310012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-310012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金伯利女郎：</div><div>我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-310201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-310201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-310201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>来，金伯利，这杯送给你。一个小小的赔礼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一杯浓黑的饮料，飘出诱人的香气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310214.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-310214.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310214.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310214.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-310214.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310214.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-310214.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310214.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>萨尔瓦多产的咖啡，一杯能让你一宿都睡不着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金伯利接住，伸出舌头好奇地舔了舔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-310013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-310013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-310013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金伯利女郎：</div><div>呜——！好苦！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-310201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-310201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-310201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>就像过去的日子一样苦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她沉默了一会儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金伯利望向她腰间那把枪的眼神，她很熟悉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310213.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310213.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310213.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310213.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310213.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310213.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310213.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310213.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>我父亲出卖了种植园的工人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310213.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310213.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310213.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310213.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310213.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310213.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310213.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310213.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>不是伊戈尔，而是血缘意义上的父亲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她望着天，无奈地笑起来，像在讲一个陌生人的故事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310213.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310213.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310213.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310213.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310213.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310213.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310213.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310213.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>“那不是枪声，而是胜利的鞭炮声”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310211.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-310211.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310211.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310211.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-310211.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310211.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-310211.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310211.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>但后来我才知道，他出卖了同胞，那是屠杀的声音。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-310013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-310013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-310013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金伯利女郎：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-310201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-310201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-310201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>后来我离开了家，被老爹和姐姐捡到，在此之后，我才加入芝诺，就这么回事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-310201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-310201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-310201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>在这儿，背叛是很常见的事情。被伙伴、被朋友、被家人……一颗脑袋比等重的黄金便宜得多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-310201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-310201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-310201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>祝你顺利，早点登上那艘属于你的船。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-310012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-310012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-310012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">金伯利女郎：</div><div>我可不可以不喝这个？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310214.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-310214.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310214.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310214.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-310214.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310214.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-310214.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310214.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>哈哈哈……如果你不喜欢的话，我不会介意。我有时候做事就是很莽撞……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她同新朋友碰杯。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_2_at_xianliao2_zone.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_2_at_xianliao2_zone\"><img alt=\"2_2_at_xianliao2_zone\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/Cg-2_2_at_xianliao2_zone.png/600px-Cg-2_2_at_xianliao2_zone.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"1612\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/13/Cg-2_2_at_xianliao2_zone.png/900px-Cg-2_2_at_xianliao2_zone.png 1.5x, https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/1/13/Cg-2_2_at_xianliao2_zone.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"908\" data-file-height=\"2440\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310213.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310213.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310213.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310213.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310213.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310213.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310213.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310213.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>卡洛塔·洛佩兹·里维拉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310214.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-310214.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310214.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310214.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-310214.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310214.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-310214.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310214.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>是不是听起来很拗口？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>洛佩拉朝着三十万公里外的发光天体伸出左手，抓握着夏夜粘稠的空气。她握不住月亮。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_2_at_xianliao2_zone1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_2_at_xianliao2_zone1\"><img alt=\"2_2_at_xianliao2_zone1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/Cg-2_2_at_xianliao2_zone1.png/600px-Cg-2_2_at_xianliao2_zone1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/Cg-2_2_at_xianliao2_zone1.png/900px-Cg-2_2_at_xianliao2_zone1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/Cg-2_2_at_xianliao2_zone1.png/1200px-Cg-2_2_at_xianliao2_zone1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310213.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310213.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310213.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310213.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310213.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310213.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310213.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310213.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>我不想见到这个名字，但老爹不让。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她凝望着这枚捉不住的天体，抓弄手指。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310213.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310213.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310213.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310213.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310213.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310213.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7d/HeadIconSmall-310213.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310213.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>姐姐跟我说：不要忘掉过去，洛佩拉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310214.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-310214.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310214.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310214.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-310214.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310214.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-310214.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310214.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>所以我就接受了，但“洛佩拉”是一个更好听的名字，我喜欢人们这么叫我。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-310201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-310201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-310201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">洛佩拉：</div><div>你呢，金伯利？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金伯利有些犹豫，而后，她缓缓张口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>娜娜，娜娜·哈丽。热情之家的……天使娜娜。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-powunei.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"powunei\"><img alt=\"powunei\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-powunei.png/600px-Cg-powunei.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-powunei.png/900px-Cg-powunei.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/aa/Cg-powunei.png/1200px-Cg-powunei.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>您还记得邓肯先生是哪一年住进荣军院的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜奶奶：</div><div>大概是五六年前，我记不清了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>五六年前。并不是遥远的二十年代或三十年代。怎么回事？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>这儿有他的照片可以看看吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>热心肠的老人点点头，走向储物间，取出一副蒙灰的相框。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜奶奶：</div><div>啊，好几年没人看过这东西了。来，这位就是他——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老人指向那位长相酷似卡森管家的人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>我们见过一位长相和他极为相似的老先生……的照片。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>那位先生叫卡森。邓肯先生用过这个名字或者这个化名吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老人捧起相框，吹去上面的积尘。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-518411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-518411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-518411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜奶奶：</div><div>没有，至少我们这儿谁都没听说过这件事。我还在军队里做医生的时候，就知道他了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518410.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-518410.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518410.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518410.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-518410.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518410.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-518410.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518410.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜奶奶：</div><div>大胆的邓肯，无所不能的邓肯，但从没听说过“卡森”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-518412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-518412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-518412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜奶奶：</div><div>很抱歉，在这件事上我帮不了你，孩子。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_2_bg_rongjunyuan2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_2_bg_rongjunyuan2\"><img alt=\"2_2_bg_rongjunyuan2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Cg-2_2_bg_rongjunyuan2.png/600px-Cg-2_2_bg_rongjunyuan2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Cg-2_2_bg_rongjunyuan2.png/900px-Cg-2_2_bg_rongjunyuan2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Cg-2_2_bg_rongjunyuan2.png/1200px-Cg-2_2_bg_rongjunyuan2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>看来必须亲眼见到邓肯先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乌鸦忽然飞来，从天上落下黑色的消息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一卷信笺随着羽毛飘落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>乌鸦……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>乌鸦栽落到庭院中。信笺随风飘落，来到手边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>揭开印章，展开信笺。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛丽安娜奶奶：</div><div>这看起来可不像好消息……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>桑托斯。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一封笔迹干净的勒索信，署名为“桑托斯”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>德洛丝医生在上校庄园。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>他给我们三天时间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>桑托斯要求芝诺方面交还被逮捕的逃兵，否则将处决医生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-300101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>联络伊戈尔将军，我们需要芝诺的援助。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "8TH-13"}}